# Frontend (Angular)

Read `docs/FRONTEND_ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/ROADMAP.md` (Phase 1–2).

## Mockup rules

- Full dashboard = composed components only — **no ad-hoc HTML** for layout/mock data.
- Mock data in `*-mock.repository.ts` / `*.mock.ts` — not in templates.
- Phase 2: six scoped sections under `features/overview/` (total-budgets, spending-this-month, etc.).

## Styles

- Global: `src/styles/` tokens only.
- Feature: one root class per component SCSS (e.g. `.total-budgets { }`).
- No `ViewEncapsulation.None` on features without ADR.

## Shell & UI kit

- Navigation: `shell/fixed-navigation/` only — not inside overview.
- Modals: `ModalService` + `AppModalComponent` only.
- Buttons: `app-button` only in modals and features.
- No `@angular/material/*` imports in `features/` or `shell/`.

## Data

- `OverviewRepository` interface; swap mock vs HTTP via providers.
- Page components use facade + `async` pipe.
